Package: ocio
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libglx0, libx11-6
Recommends: libxcursor1, libxi6, libxinerama1, libxrandr2
Description: Raylib interactive eye-tracking educational demo
 Ocio is an interactive educational demonstration that tracks the mouse pointer
 with an animated eye, illustrating real-time rendering, dynamic linker mechanics,
 and Linux operating system packaging pipelines without high-level wrappers.
